{{- subject = "Employee leaving: " + employee_name -}}
<p>Hello {{ recipient_name | html.escape }},</p>
<p>An exit dated {{ termination_date }} was recorded for <strong>{{ employee_name | html.escape }}</strong>.</p>
<p>Asset returns, the exit settlement and offboarding tasks can be followed on the employee record.</p>
{{~ if action_url ~}}
{{ button "Open employee record" action_url }}
{{~ end ~}}
